Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:45.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《侏罗纪公园》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家注意上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, heads up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.04,0:01:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,清出场地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 往下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 保持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（努布拉岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:52.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哥斯达黎加以西120英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 推柜组 上去！- 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, pushing team, move in there. - Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们开最强的电击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want tasers on full charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 预备 - 快些 回到位置上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steady! - Come on, step back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,推呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开锁 装卸组 让开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're unlocked. Loading team, step away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,开栅的上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gate keeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔福瑞 开栅！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jophery, raise the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,封住口子 别让她跑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block the opening! Don't let her get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼她退后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work her back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.09,0:03:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:44.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多明尼加共和国）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:48.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（戴奥斯琥珀矿坑）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 万尼多！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 边尼多{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说老哈没有来 怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this I hear at the airport? Hammond's not even here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他托我向你道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sends his apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,工人家属告状 索赔二千万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are facing a $20 million lawsuit by the family of that worker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连见我一面也嫌麻烦吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're telling me that Hammond can't even be bothered to see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须提早动身 去安慰他那办离婚的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to leave early. He wants to be with his daughter. She's getting a divorce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我谅解 但是我们被通知马上要处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that but we've been advised to deal with the situation now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险公司…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The insurance company…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险业者认为这件意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underwriters feel the accident's raised…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,凸显公园的安全大有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}serious safety questions about the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这使得投资人非常地焦虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes the investors very, very anxious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得已答应 要彻底检查场地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to promise to conduct a very thorough on-site inspection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈蒙最恨检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammond hates inspections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会延缓一切进度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They slow everything down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,万尼多 他们会抽走资金 那会使他进行得更慢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juanito, they'll pull the funding. That'll slow him down even more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有两位专家背书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If two experts sign off on the island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险公司就会休兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the insurance guys will back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找了一位伊恩马康姆 但是他们认为他太时髦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already got lan Malcolm, but they think he's too trendy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要亚伦葛兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want Alan Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛兰？你休想叫他离开蒙大拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant? You'll never get him out of Montana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为葛兰像我一样 是挖掘狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Grant's like me. He's a digger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:49.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴德兰斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:53.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（靠近蒙大拿州蛇河）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛兰博士！塞特勒博士！我们准备好再试一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, Dr. Sattler, we're ready to try again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate computers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有同感！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feeling's mutual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常这要多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long does this usually take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是立刻回应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should bring an immediate return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把雷达波射入地下 骨头的影像弹回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot the radar into the ground and the bone bounces the image back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹回来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bounces it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个新程式真是不可思议！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This new program's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再进步下去 过两年我们就不必挖掘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few more years'development and we won't even have to dig anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还有什么乐趣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the fun in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有点变形 但是不是电脑有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little distorted but I don't think it's the computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是后颈韧带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Postmortem contraction of the posterior neck ligaments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迅猛龙？- 对 形状也很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Velociraptor? - Yes. Good shape too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有五 六英尺高 我猜它有九英尺长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's five, six feet high. I'm guessing nine feet long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧那强壮的…- 你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at the extraordinary…- What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:07:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他摸过它 葛兰博士和机器不相容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He touched it. Dr. Grant's not machine compatible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 他们把我容进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got it in for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那腕部的半月形骨 难怪这些家伙学会了飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at the half-moon-shaped bones in the wrists.\nIt's no wonder these guys learned how to fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许恐龙 和今天的鸟类相同处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe dinosaurs have more in common with present-day birds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,多于和爬虫类相同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than they do with reptiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那耻骨 向后转就像鸟类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the pubic bone…turned backward, just like a bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那脊椎骨节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the vertebrae, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,布满气囊和空凹 像鸟一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of air sacs and hollows…Just like a bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至「猛禽」 也是指猎食之鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even the word "raptor" means "bird of prey."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来并不很吓人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't look very scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是一只六英尺高的火鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a six-foot turkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,火鸡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A turkey, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 试想自己…处在白垩纪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Try to imagine yourself in the Cretaceous period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你走到开阔地 第一次见到这六英尺高的火鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your first look at this six-foot turkey as you enter a clearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的行动像鸟 微微地点着头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He moves like a bird lightly bobbing his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保持静止不动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you keep still because you think that maybe his visual acuity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他看动的东西时眼才利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is based on movement, like T-rex, and he'll lose you if you don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是错了！迅猛龙不是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no, not velociraptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞪着他 他会回瞪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stare at him and he just stares right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是他攻击的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when the attack comes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是由正面 是由侧面攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not from the front, but from the side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是另外两只攻击 你根本不知他们来自何方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the other two raptors you didn't even know were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为迅猛龙是群攻猎者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because velociraptor's a pack hunter, you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他采用联合攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He uses coordinated attack patterns…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天他们大举出动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he is out in force today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向你挥舞那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he slashes at you with this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,六寸长伸缩自如的中趾利爪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a six-inch retractable claw like a razor on the middle toe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不像狮子费事的 咬住你喉部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't bother to bite your jugular, like a lion, say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不来这套 他在你身上乱抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He slashes at you…here or here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许横划开肚子 肚破肠流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe across the belly spilling your intestines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说他们吃你时 你还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is you are alive when they start to eat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:09:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们要有点敬畏之心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know try to show a little respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 你若是要吓孩子们 干脆拔枪对着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Alan, if you wanted to scare the kid you could have pulled a gun on him, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 我知道 可是小孩子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. Kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要这种小孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to have one of those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要那个小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want that kid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只不过是一个品种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a breed of child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛兰博士 可能很有趣！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, could be intriguing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 小孩有什么不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what's so wrong with kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 听着 小孩们吵闹 脏乱而且很花钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Ellie, look. They're noisy, they're messy, they're expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,养小孩便宜 便宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheap, cheap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩都有体臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有些小孩臭 婴儿有体臭 - 你饶了我吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some of them smell. Babies smell. - Give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它掩盖起来 - 把现场掩盖起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cover the site! - Cover up the dig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 掩盖坑洞 - 掩盖现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell them to shut down! - Cut the machine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都盖上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover it all up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 盖在上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, pull it over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 熄火 熄火好吗？熄火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cut it, will you? Cut it out! Shut it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you think you're doing in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们保留的酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! We were saving that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为今天保留 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For today. I guarantee it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who in God's name do you think you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰哈蒙德 很高兴终于见到你 葛博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Hammond. And I'm delighted to meet you finally in person, Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我每年赞助五万元很值得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that my fifty thousand dollars a year has been well spent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这个浑蛋是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, who's the jerk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的原始植物学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our paleobotanist, Doctor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞特勒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sattler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 这是哈蒙德先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, this is Mr. Hammond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞特勒博士 原谅我来得轰动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the dramatic entrance, Dr. Sattler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我骂过「浑蛋」吗？- 我们有一点匆忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I say "jerk"? - But we're in a wee bit of a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝一杯好吗？不要让酒热了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you have a drink? We won't let it get warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！坐下！坐下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 这个给我 - 我只要喝一两杯 那是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. Let me…- We'll just get a glass or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必 不必！我可以自己来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I can manage this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨房的事我很熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my way around a kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要开门见山的说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'll get right to the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you…both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一眼就能识人 这是我的天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell instantly about people. It's a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哥斯达黎加外海 拥有海岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own an island off the coast of Costa Rica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向政府租的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've leased it from the government, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年来在岛上建立生物保存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've spent the last five years setting up a kind of biological preserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的可观 不惜工本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really spectacular. Spared no expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在肯亚的保育区 相形之下像个宠物园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the one I've got down in Kenya look like a petting zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的吸引力 准会使儿童发狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no doubt our attractions will drive kids out of their minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么「吸引力」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是吸引力嘛！亲爱的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small versions of adults, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是小孩 是每一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just kids, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果律师没搞垮我 明年就可以开张！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to open next year…that is, if the lawyers don't kill me first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕律师 你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care for lawyers. Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不认识什么律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't really know any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我那些投资人 正找我麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a particular pebble in my shoe represents my investors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:11:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定要客观的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says that they insist on outside opinions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的意见？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of opinions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的意见 不必评得太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kind, not to put too fine a point on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说吧！你们在本行中是佼佼者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your particular field, you're the top minds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能说动你们 批准这公园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I could just persuade you to sign off on the park…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是得到你们背书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, give it your endorsement, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是一句证言 我就可以恢复计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe even pen a wee testimonial…I could get back on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们何必在乎我们的想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they care what we think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么样的公园？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of park is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是你的本行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right up your alley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我提个建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们何不结伴去那边度个周末{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come down…Just the pair of you for the weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很乐意 听原始植物学家的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to have an opinion of a paleobotanist as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的喷射机正在巧朵待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a jet standing by at Choteau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…很抱歉 这是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. This is impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天刚挖起一具新骨骸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just dug up a new skeleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以…全额赞助 你们的挖掘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could compensate you by fully funding your dig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…非常时期…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a very unusual time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再赞助三年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a further three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机在那里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是呀 好！- 干杯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Okay. - Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:21.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哥斯达黎加 圣荷西市）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶吉森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Dodgson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该叫出我的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't use my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶吉森！陶吉森在此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got Dodgson here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 没有人在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Nobody cares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,帽子不错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想打扮得像情报员吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to look like, a secret agent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,七十五万元 每交一个胚胎加付五万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven fifty. On delivery, 50000 more for each viable embryo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你把十五个物种都弄到 就有一百五十万元进帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 1.5 million, if you get all 15 species off the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会全部弄到手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll get them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住要活胚胎 若不是活的就没有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember…viable embryos. They're no use to us if they don't survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么运送他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to transport them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,底层可以转开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bottom screws open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了 我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有夹层又凉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cooled and compartmentalized inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真厉害！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys…Oh, that's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至于可以任由海关检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Customs can even check it if they want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 让我看看！- 看吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see. - Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面的冷却剂可维持36小时 - 不是薄荷脑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enough coolant inside for 36 hours. - No menthol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.58,0:14:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,胚胎必须在这段时间 运到圣荷西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The embryos have to be back here in San Jose by then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看你们船上的人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's up to your guy on the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚七点钟在东码头 要确保他会到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}7:00 tomorrow night on the east dock. Make sure he gets it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算如何通过安全检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you planning to beat security?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开个十八分钟的天窗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an 18-minute window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,十八分钟 使你公司的研发进步了十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen minutes and your company catches up on ten years of research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶吉森 不要太小气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get cheap on me, Dodgson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要怪哈蒙德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Hammond's mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是…挖掘恐龙的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two dig up dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是想挖到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We try to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须适应马康姆博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to get used to Dr. Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他患了数学家特有的任性症{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He suffers from a deplorable excess of personality especially for a mathematician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是混乱方程式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaotician, actually. John doesn't subscribe to chaos…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰不赞成混乱 尤其是说到他那科学小计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}particularly what it has to say about his science project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:16:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从未有效地说明岛上的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never been able to sufficiently explain your concerns about the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这行为系统是假想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the behavior of the system in phase space?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一叠时髦的数字统计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A load, if I may say so, of fashionable number crunching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 别捏我的膝盖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is not. - I do wish you wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞博士！葛博士！你们听说过混乱原理吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Sattler, Dr. Grant, you've heard of chaos theory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有？不是一次方程式吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Nonlinear equations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的吸引力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange attractors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞博士！我不相信 你对引力原理没概念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Sattler, I refuse to believe that you aren't familiar with the concept of attraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带科学家来 你带摇滚明星来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bring scientists, you bring a rock star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,风势恶劣 我们必须急遽下坠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad wind shears. We have to drop pretty fast, so hold on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要抓紧 这可能会颠簸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it can be Just a little thrilling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对！要用那个环扣这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need that piece over there, and that piece…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你扣好已经着陆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have landed by the time you get it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:30.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（侏罗纪公园）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:59.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 电压一万伏特）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长五十英里的周边网墙筑好没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The full 50 miles of perimeter fence are in place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有水泥护沟 行动侦测系统都好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the concrete moats, and the motion-sensor tracking systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐纳老弟 放心吧！尽量的享受！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donald, dear boy, relax. Try and enjoy yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 坦白说 这可不是周末游览{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get something straight, John. This is not a weekend excursion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是要严查此岛上的安全性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a serious investigation of the stability of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表你的投资人 非常关切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your investors, whom I represent, are deeply concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十八小时内 如果他们和我未被说服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-eight hours from now, if they're not convinced, I'm not convinced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会叫你关门 约翰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shut you down, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十八小时内 你会向我赔罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 48 hours, I'll be accepting your apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里减速 慢！慢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, slow down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！停！停！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不应该在这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 这类物种白垩纪时已灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan, this species of veriforman's been extinct since the Cretaceous period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说这东西是…这东西…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing is extinct. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一只恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…It's a dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了！你这个疯狂的龟儿子做到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it. You crazy son of a bitch, you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 可以撕掉 冷血动物法则了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could just tear up the rule book on coldbloodedness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这法则完全错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't apply. They're totally wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是「热血生物」 - 这东西不是活在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a warm-blooded creature. - This thing doesn't live in a swamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的脖子有25？27英尺长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's got what, a 25, 27-foot neck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,腕龙？30英尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brachiosaur? Thirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十英尺！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方会让我们大发财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make a fortune with this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能跑多快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fast are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴龙能跑时速32英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We clocked the T-rex at 32 miles an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,霸王龙属的暴龙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-rex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有暴龙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you've got a T-rex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有暴龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a T-rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.43,0:21:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,头低下免得昏倒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your head between your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:22:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士！亲爱的塞博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, my dear Dr. Sattler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临侏罗纪公园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome…to Jurassic Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他们成群结队的活动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're moving in herds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的成群！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do move in herds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.41,0:22:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好！大家好！亲爱的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}G'day, g'day, g'day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最先进的游乐园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the most advanced amusement park in the entire world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,集尖端科技之大成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}incorporating all the latest technologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.55,0:23:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是指云霄飞车 那个到处都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not talking just about rides. Everybody has rides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.03,0:23:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们创造了生物吸引力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have made living biological attractions so astounding…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊世骇俗 将抓住全球的想像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they'll capture the imagination of the entire planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到我们失业了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说要「绝种」了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you mean "extinct"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家坐下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why don't you all sit down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐纳 坐下！坐下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donald, sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.26,0:23:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 他来了！我来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Here he comes…Oh…here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.06,0:24:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.97,0:24:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问好呀！问好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.27,0:24:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 约翰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我有台词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. I've got lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.51,0:24:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！好！我还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fine, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how did I get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.81,0:24:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我需要一滴血 你的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I'll need a drop of blood…your blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 那样会痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, that hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 这是同体生物的奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, John. It's all part of the miracle of cloning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 约翰 - 约翰 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, John. - Hello, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.83,0:24:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,与什么同体？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloned from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因不能再造完整的DNA索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood extraction has never recreated an intact DNA strand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.83,0:24:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有太多断层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without massive sequence gaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,原始去氧核糖核酸 从何取得？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paleo DNA…from what source?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上哪找一亿年前的恐龙血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you get 100-million-year-old dinosaur blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.95,0:24:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.85,0:24:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,DNA先生 你是从哪来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. DNA. Where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.95,0:24:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你的血来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一滴血 就有几十亿DNA索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one drop of your blood contains billions of strands of DNA…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.85,0:25:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是建造生命的「砖块」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the building blocks of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.86,0:25:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这种DNA索 是建造生命的蓝图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A DNA strand like me is a blueprint for building a living thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.93,0:25:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 灭绝了几百万年的动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometimes, animals that went extinct millions of years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.94,0:25:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如恐龙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like dinosaurs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.47,0:25:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下蓝图让我们去找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}left their blueprints behind for us to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.37,0:25:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just had to know where to look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.84,0:25:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一亿年前的蚊子 就像今天的蚊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred million years ago there were mosquitoes, just like today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,像今天一样吸动物的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, just like today, they fed on the blood of animals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至吸恐龙的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.05,0:25:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候吸恐龙血之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, after biting a dinosaur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,蚊子会停在树枝上 被树液包住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mosquito would land on the branch of a tree and get stuck in the sap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.89,0:25:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间一久 树液硬化成了化石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a long time, the tree sap would get hard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像恐龙的骨骸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and become fossilized, just like a dinosaur bone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.10,0:25:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,树液保存了蚊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}preserving the mosquito inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.37,0:25:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,树液化石又称为琥珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fossilized tree sap which we call "amber"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.31,0:25:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,包住蚊子等了几百万年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}waited for millions of years with the mosquito inside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到侏罗纪公园的科学家前来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until Jurassic Park scientists came along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.68,0:26:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用高科技 抽取蚊子吸的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using sophisticated techniques they extract the preserved blood from the mosquito…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.09,0:26:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,中奖一样获得恐龙DNA{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bingo…dino DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,完整的DNA索 有三十亿遗传密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full DNA strand contains three billion genetic codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.30,0:26:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一秒钟看一种 一天看八小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we looked at screens like these once a second for eight hours a day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看完DNA索也要两年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd take two years to look at the entire DNA strand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么长的DNA索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.54,0:26:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于它很老所以尽是漏洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since it's so old, it's full of holes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.01,0:26:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就要我们的遗传学家接手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's where our geneticists take over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,思想的机器「超级电脑」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking-machine super computers and gene sequencers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.62,0:26:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因顺序在几分钟内破解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}break down the strand in minutes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.25,0:26:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现出了DNA序中的断层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and virtual-reality displays show our geneticists the gaps in the DNA sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用青蛙的DNA序 来补漏洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use the complete DNA of a frog to fill in the holes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.36,0:26:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼出完整的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and complete the code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.14,0:26:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们能造恐龙宝宝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we can make a baby dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.47,0:27:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个只是暂时的 过程当然要配乐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This score is only temporary. It all has very dramatic music, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.35,0:27:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,激昂的进行曲 曲子还没作好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A march or something. It hasn't been written yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.55,0:27:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然要继续参观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, of course, the tour moves on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.47,0:27:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛勤工作的科学家…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These hard-working cowpokes you see behind the glass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 真是帅呆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is overwhelming, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.60,0:27:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人物是机器卡通吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these characters autoerotica?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.77,0:27:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 这里没有机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. We have no animatronics here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.82,0:27:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是创造 侏罗纪公园奇迹的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people are the real miracle workers ofJurassic Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.82,0:27:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是未受精的蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unfertilized emu or ostrich eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.59,0:27:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 怎样阻断细胞间接分裂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. How do you interrupt the cellular mitosis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.09,0:27:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否看看未受精的蛋？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we see the unfertilized eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了！快了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.00,0:27:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是整个团队的遗传工程师…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now a whole team of genetic engineers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以停止吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you stop these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.94,0:27:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这有点像游览{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's a kind of a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.01,0:27:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.14,0:27:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.61,0:27:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.95,0:27:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以那样做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can they do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.32,0:28:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 往内陆的船七点开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reminder. The boat for the mainland will be leaving at 1900 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体员工于6点45分前 到码头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel be at the dock no later than 1845.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得有误！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No exceptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.53,0:28:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}G'day, Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.33,0:28:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good day, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在转动蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's turning the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.85,0:28:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你看 正好赶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perfect timing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我上船之前蛋都孵化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hoped they'd hatch before I had to go to the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.35,0:28:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利！怎么不早说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要在此看她们出世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insist on being here when they're born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.39,0:28:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.30,0:28:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙！加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.87,0:28:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！快加油呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.37,0:29:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.98,0:29:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好！推呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good. Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.91,0:29:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常好！- 我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very good. - Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.18,0:29:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,推呀！加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.29,0:29:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来了！出来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.30,0:29:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们对最先接触的人印象最深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They imprint on the first creature they come in contact with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 帮助她们来信任我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Helps them to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.09,0:29:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上的小东西出世时我都会在场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been present for the birth of every little creature on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.41,0:29:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 在野地出生的不算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, surely not the ones that have bred in the wilds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.15,0:29:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实她们不能在野地繁殖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually they can't breed in the wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.95,0:29:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,数量控制是本园的安全项目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Population control is one of our security precautions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,侏罗纪公园不准私生恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no unauthorized breeding in Jurassic Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.02,0:29:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道她们不能繁殖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know they can't breed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.53,0:29:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为园里的动物都是母的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because all the animals in Jurassic Park are female.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.03,0:29:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们精心设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've engineered them that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.43,0:30:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.34,0:30:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.57,0:30:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,血温似乎有华氏80多度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood temperature seems like a high 80s maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.04,0:30:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小吴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.94,0:30:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,91度！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety-one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.45,0:30:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恒温动物？它能保持这温度？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homeothermic? It holds that temperature?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.18,0:30:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.45,0:30:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再请问 你怎么知道都是母的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But again, how do you know they're all female?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人到园里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does somebody go out in the park…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.51,0:30:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,掀恐龙的裙子看吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pull up the dinosaurs' skirts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.59,0:30:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制她们的染色体 其实这也不难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We control their chromosomes. It's really not that difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.26,0:30:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的脊椎胚胎 天生是母的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All vertebrate embryos are inherently female anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.87,0:30:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要在发展时期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They require an extra hormone given…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.17,0:30:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,适时加所需的荷尔蒙就变公的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the right developmental stage to make them male.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.57,0:30:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是不给她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We simply deny them that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.27,0:30:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不给她们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deny them that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.81,0:30:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你尝试要控制的事 是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, the kind of control you're attempting is…It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.78,0:30:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化史如果有教我们什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's one thing the history of evolution has taught us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.28,0:30:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是「生命不受抑制」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's that life will not be contained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.32,0:30:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「生命是奔放的」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life breaks free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.62,0:30:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命开拓新的领域 冲破障碍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It expands to new territories and crashes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有痛苦甚至危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}through barriers painfully, maybe even dangerously, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.39,0:30:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是生命如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命在此！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.80,0:31:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说全是母的也会繁殖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're implying that a group composed entirely of female animals will breed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.93,0:31:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我只是说生命会找出路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm simply saying that life finds a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.52,0:31:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么物种？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What species is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.53,0:31:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是迅猛龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a velociraptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.26,0:31:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你繁殖猛禽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bred raptors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.95,0:31:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士 我刚才正说到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, as I was saying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.68,0:31:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你入园之前 我们已备好午餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we laid on lunch for you before you set out into the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.85,0:31:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的美食大师傅… - 他们在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our gourmet chef, Alejandro… - What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.69,0:31:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂她们吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山卓准备了好菜 智利海鲈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alejandro has prepared a delightful menu for us. Chilean sea bass, I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.01,0:32:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,请？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该把她们全部消减{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should all be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.72,0:32:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳勃马杜尔 我从肯亚调来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert Muldoon, my game warden from Kenya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧张多虑但是最了解猛禽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of an alarmist, I'm afraid, but knows more about raptors than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.52,0:33:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的新陈代谢成长率如何？生长率又怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of metabolism do they have? What's their growth rate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.03,0:33:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们八个月大就能杀生 我是说真的致命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're lethal at eight months…and I do mean lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.23,0:33:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猎杀过许多会猎杀的东西 但她们的速度…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hunted most things that can hunt you, but the way these things move…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.86,0:33:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在两足动物算快吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fast for a biped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.23,0:33:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快如猎豹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheetah speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.83,0:33:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在开阔地能跑五六十英里时速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty, sixty miles per hour, if they ever got out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.54,0:33:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是跳跃高手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're astonishing jumpers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.87,0:33:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！所以我们非常小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're taking extreme precautions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.32,0:33:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们有智慧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they show intelligence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.34,0:33:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们表现得很聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're extremely intelligent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.15,0:33:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有排除困难的智慧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even problem-solving intelligence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.45,0:33:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是那只大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.85,0:33:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们原本繁殖八只 但是她一来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bred eight originally, but when she came in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.99,0:33:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开始扬威 杀得只剩下两只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she took over the pride and killed all but two of the others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.86,0:33:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一只在看你的时候 在用心机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one when she looks at you, you can see she's working things out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.16,0:33:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要这样喂她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we have to feed them like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂食的时候 她让其余的去撞网墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had them all attacking the fences when the feeders came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.47,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,网墙通了电是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fences are electrified though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 但她们从来不撞同一处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, but they never attacked the same place twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.88,0:33:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们有系统地 找网墙的弱点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were testing the fences for weaknesses systematically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.88,0:33:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.63,0:34:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.49,0:34:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁饿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.90,0:34:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢冒险的游客 可以走丛林水路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More adventurous guests can opt for ourjungle river cruise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.50,0:34:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,近观有翼的恐龙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or for a close-up look at our majestic winged dinosaurs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这些项目都没有完工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of these attractions are ready yet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.10,0:34:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是先开放你们下面的游程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the park will open with the basic tour you're about to take…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.11,0:34:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他游程在6或12个月后开放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then other rides will come on-line six or twelve months after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.11,0:34:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对令人叹为观止 不惜工本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely spectacular designs. Spared no expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.62,0:34:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以狮子大开口 一天的费用两千 一万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can charge anything we want…2000 a day, 10000 a day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.42,0:34:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都愿意付{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and people will pay it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.75,0:34:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还卖商品 我建议…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's the merchandise. I can personally…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.62,0:34:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐纳！唐纳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donald! Donald!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.12,0:34:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这公园 不是只迎合超级富翁的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This park was not built to cater only for the super rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.63,0:34:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上人人都有权 欣赏这些动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in the world has the right to enjoy these animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.66,0:34:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他们会看到 我们会订出优待的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. They will. What, we'll have a coupon day or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.27,0:35:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对大自然缺乏谦卑 这才叫人害怕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, the lack of humility before nature that's being displayed here staggers me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.75,0:35:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,马博士 谢谢你 但是你和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Dr. Malcolm, but I think things are a little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.12,0:35:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所怕的不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bit different than you and I had feared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.48,0:35:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 更可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. They're a lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.78,0:35:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没参观园区…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a second. We haven't even seen the park yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.89,0:35:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 唐纳 让他说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Donald, let him talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.66,0:35:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要听各方意见 真的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason. I want to hear every viewpoint. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.89,0:35:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你没看见这样做的危险吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see the danger. John, inherent in what you're doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗传是地球上最可怕的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genetic power's the most awesome force the planet's ever seen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.18,0:35:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等于是小孩偷玩大人的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you wield it like a kid that's found his dad's gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.31,0:35:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,事前谈危险不恰当…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hardly appropriate to start…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.87,0:35:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我说句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second. If I may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.48,0:35:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在此用的科学力量问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you the problem with the scientific power you're using here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.60,0:35:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在于它没有任何约束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't require any discipline to attain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.89,0:35:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你读别人的研究 然后采取行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read what others had done and you took the next step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.59,0:35:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的知识不是自己的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't earn the knowledge for yourselves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.37,0:35:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不负任何责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you don't take any responsibility for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.40,0:35:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在天才们的肩膀上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stood on the shoulders of geniuses…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.70,0:35:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快地去做成一些事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to accomplish something as fast as you could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没弄清楚就已经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and before you even knew what you had…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.64,0:35:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,申请到专利 然后包装 现在快要销售了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you patented it, and packaged it and slapped it on a plastic lunch box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.71,0:35:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要出售它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're selling it. You want to sell it. Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.41,0:36:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我们的批评有失公道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're giving us our due credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.12,0:36:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的科学家们 成就了前无古人的创举{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our scientists have done things which nobody's ever done before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.32,0:36:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的专家只知埋头硬干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your scientists were so preoccupied with whether or not they could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.52,0:36:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没思考该不该做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they didn't stop to think if they should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.73,0:36:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,兀鹰 兀鹰正濒临绝种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Condors. Condors are on the verge of extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.76,0:36:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在岛上造一群秃鹰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was to create a flock of condors on this island…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.83,0:36:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就没话说了！- 不 等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you wouldn't have anything to say. - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.24,0:36:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个物种并非因为砍伐森林…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't some species that was obliterated by deforestation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.04,0:36:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是建水坝而绝种的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the building of a dam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.48,0:36:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙…曾经有机会生存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaurs had their shot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大自然要他们灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nature selected them for extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.38,0:36:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然有人因噎废食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply don't understand this Luddite attitude…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.51,0:36:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其还是个科学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially from a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.69,0:36:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在发明的光照耀下 怎能不行动？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we stand in the light of discovery and not act?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.96,0:36:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,发明有什么好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so great about discovery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.36,0:36:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是暴力 它是狂暴刺穿的行为 到处留疤痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a violent, penetrative act that scars what it explores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.56,0:36:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所谓的发明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you call discovery…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫它做「强奸自然界」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call the rape of the natural world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.97,0:36:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是你如何能了解一种灭绝的生态系统？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, how can you know anything about an extinct ecosystem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.07,0:37:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此你如何设想 控制的办法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And therefore, how could you ever assume that you can control it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.28,0:37:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这栋楼里有含毒的植物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have plants in this building that are poisonous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.28,0:37:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见它好看而摆设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked them because they look good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.28,0:37:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是恐龙有侵略性 它不管时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these are aggressive living things that have no idea…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.98,0:37:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,必要时它们会用暴力自卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what century they're in, and they'll defend themselves violently, if necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.09,0:37:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士！如果在座有一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, if there's one person here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.29,0:37:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能欣赏我在做的努力…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could appreciate what I'm trying to do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.00,0:37:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界急遽的改变 我们在迎头赶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world has just changed so radically and we're all running to catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.60,0:37:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想妄下论断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to jump to any conclusions, but look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.81,0:37:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是恐龙和人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaurs and man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.51,0:37:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个物种相差六千五百万年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}two species separated by 65 million years of evolution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.51,0:37:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽然间被送做堆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have just been suddenly thrown back into the mix together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能期望什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we possibly have the slightest idea of what to expect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.35,0:37:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.22,0:37:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.26,0:37:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们原本是来帮我辩护的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're meant to come down here and defend me against these characters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今只有吸血的律师 帮我说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the only one I've got on my side is the bloodsucking lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.43,0:37:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.84,0:38:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.74,0:38:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们四个将在园里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You four are going to have a spot of company out in the park…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.59,0:38:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们安排的观众同游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}spend a little time with our target audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.35,0:38:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.95,0:38:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.49,0:38:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢着 别撞倒我 - 我们想念你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Careful with the old man. - We missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外公 谢谢你的礼物 - 礼物好棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for the presents. - We loved the presents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.66,0:38:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很高兴 - 坐直升机好玩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were great. - Did you enjoy the helicopter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.69,0:38:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩 它下坠我们上升{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it went down, and we all went right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.50,0:38:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 来 别太靠近车辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now kids, come away. Not too close to the cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.97,0:38:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可不可爱？讨不讨人喜欢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't they lovely? Aren't they glorious, though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些将是你们下午的交通工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These will be your transports for the afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.08,0:38:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有司机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No drivers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.11,0:38:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有！没有 用不着司机 这是电动的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No drivers. They're electric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.53,0:38:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路中央的轨道上跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They run on this track in the middle of the roadway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.02,0:38:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全无污染 最好的路线 不惜工本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally nonpolluting. Top of the line. Spared no expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.49,0:38:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是雷射唱片唯读记忆体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an interactive CD-ROM.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.19,0:38:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没有？你按右边 它就会讲你要听的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just touch the right part of the screen and it talks about whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.49,0:39:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝 你那里好坐吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex, Darling, you're all right in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.03,0:39:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞博士 跟我来 葛博士 上第二辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Sattler, come with me. Dr. Grant, come in the second car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.30,0:39:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和塞博士坐一辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with Dr. Sattler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.52,0:39:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读过你的书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read your book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…那好呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's…That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为恐龙变化成鸟吗？他们都是变成鸟吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think dinosaurs turned into birds and that's where they all went?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.23,0:39:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有少数物种也许曾经进化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a few species may have evolved along those lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.87,0:39:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看它们决不像鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sure don't look like birds to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.74,0:39:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说有块陨石…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that there was this meteor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.65,0:39:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,落在墨西哥某处 撞出一个大坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hit the Earth someplace down in Mexico and made this big crater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.35,0:39:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.05,0:39:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.75,0:39:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 你要坐那一辆车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim. Which car were you planning on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.09,0:39:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你坐同一辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whichever one you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.46,0:40:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在「全知」上读到过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I read about this thing in Omni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.17,0:40:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块陨石产生热度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About this meteor making all this heat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.77,0:40:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成一团钻石沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it made a bunch of diamond dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.93,0:40:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变了气候 恐龙死于改变的气候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that changed the weather, and they died because of the weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.17,0:40:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我的老师提到另外一本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then my teacher tells me about this other book…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.08,0:40:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克写的书 贝克说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a guy named Bakker, and he says…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.38,0:40:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我应该和你坐 对你有好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said I should ride with you because it would be good for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.48,0:40:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,船正在上客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boat is now loading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.29,0:40:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都要赶七点离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone must be on the dock for the 1900 hour departure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.19,0:40:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,气象局在追踪离我们西方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}National Weather Service is tracking a tropical storm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.84,0:40:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,约75英里的热带暴风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about 75 miles west of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.33,0:40:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么不在奥兰多建园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I build in Orlando?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.13,0:40:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会注意 也许又会转向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep an eye on it. Maybe it'll swing south, like the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.41,0:40:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 展开游览节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, start the tour program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.82,0:40:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your butts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.73,0:40:59.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游览开始）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.00,0:41:06.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游客中心 第一区）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.51,0:41:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看那一种恐龙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of dinosaurs are we going to see now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.01,0:41:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 开动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. A ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.91,0:41:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入未来的行列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the door and join the future, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.62,0:41:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝救我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God help us. We're in the hands of engineers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部份行程中 适当的资讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}During most of your tour, the appropriate information…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.47,0:41:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会自动为你显示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be automatically selected and displayed for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.23,0:41:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 快看！- 只要触摸荧光幕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, look! - Simply touch the area of the screen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.46,0:41:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相应的图标 - 我们会撞上大门吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- displaying the appropriate icon. - Are we gonna hit that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.43,0:41:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临侏罗纪公园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Jurassic Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.57,0:41:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面养着什么 大金刚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have they got in there, King Kong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.75,0:42:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到的是客人凯利的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voice you're now hearing is Richard Kiley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.66,0:42:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不惜工本 - 在右边你将看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We spared no expense. - If you look to the right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.69,0:42:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一群恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will see a herd of the first…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.36,0:42:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫作「双脊龙」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dinosaurs on our tour, called dilophosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.36,0:42:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脊龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dilophosaurus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.47,0:42:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.80,0:42:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最早的肉食动物之一 其实双脊龙有毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the earliest carnivores we now know dilophosaurus is actually poisonous…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.01,0:42:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它向猎物喷毒汁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}spitting its venom at its prey, causing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.97,0:42:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成对方失明和瘫痪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}blindness and eventually paralysis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,任由它大快朵颐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}allowing the carnivore to eat at its leisure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.88,0:42:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它使本园增添美丽 却又致命的特色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This makes dilophosaurus a beautiful but deadly addition to Jurassic Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.89,0:42:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 双脊龙在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan…where…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.30,0:42:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.34,0:42:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,车灯亮却没反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vehicle headlights are on and they're not responding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.79,0:42:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,车不会没电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those shouldn't be running off the car batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.21,0:42:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第151项目今天故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Item 151 on today's glitch list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,游乐园和动物园的毛病都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all the problems of a major theme park and a major zoo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.83,0:43:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而电脑还没建立起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the computers aren't even on their feet yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.42,0:43:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.06,0:43:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,人命关天 你还有空吃糖？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our lives are in your hands, and you have butterfingers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.54,0:43:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是白干了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm totally unappreciated in my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.16,0:43:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以用最少的人 控制全园区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can run this park from this room with minimal staff for up to 3 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.08,0:43:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自动化容易吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that kind of automation is easy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.18,0:43:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,便宜吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or cheap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.58,0:43:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识谁能建立八连机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anybody who can network eight connection machines…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.95,0:43:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样改正两百万个程式？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and debug two million lines of code for what I bid for this job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.59,0:43:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有我倒想见识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if you can, I'd love to see him try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.06,0:43:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯 你财务困难我很同情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your financial problems, Dennis, I really am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.66,0:43:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是你的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they are your problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.46,0:43:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你没有错 都是我不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. You're absolutely right. Everything's my problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.90,0:43:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再跟你争论财务问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not get drawn into another financial debate with you, Dennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.57,0:43:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.97,0:43:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有争论过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been hardly any debate at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.87,0:43:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪别人犯错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame people for their mistakes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.67,0:43:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我一定 要他们为错付代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do ask that they pay for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.98,0:43:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了！岳父！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.78,0:43:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯！前灯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis, the headlights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.38,0:43:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们回来后 我改正好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll debug the tour program when they get back, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.72,0:44:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？那会吃掉计算环 会暂时失灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? It'll eat a lot of compute cycles.\nWe'll lose part of the system for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.52,0:44:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆有限 不能做所有的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a finite amount of memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.52,0:44:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要半小时…？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna compile for a half an hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.69,0:44:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家安静！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.89,0:44:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快到暴龙园地了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're approaching the tyrannosaur paddock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.95,0:45:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝创造恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God creates dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.75,0:45:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝毁灭恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God destroys dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.85,0:45:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝创造人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God creates man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.39,0:45:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,人毁灭上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man destroys God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.15,0:45:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,人创造恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man creates dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.79,0:45:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙吃男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaurs…eat man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.96,0:45:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人继承了地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman inherits the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.67,0:45:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要尝试食诱暴龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try to tempt the rex now. Keep watching the fence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.99,0:45:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只羊会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen to the goat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.23,0:45:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会吃那只羊吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna eat the goat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.29,0:45:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好过瘾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.70,0:45:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.43,0:45:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没吃过羊肉吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had lamb chops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.53,0:45:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好吃素！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to be a vegetarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.04,0:46:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴龙不要被喂食 他要猎食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-rex doesn't want to be fed. He wants to hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.11,0:46:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,六千五百万年的天性改不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just suppress 65 million years of gut instinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.94,0:46:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于在恐龙之旅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now eventually you do plan to have dinosaurs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排恐龙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on your dinosaur tour, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.25,0:46:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.25,0:46:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.65,0:46:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真恨那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hate that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.76,0:47:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴龙不服从即定模式 不听摆布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the tyrannosaur doesn't obey any set patterns or park schedules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.47,0:47:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是混乱之本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the essence of chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.30,0:47:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不懂混乱原理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still not clear on chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.27,0:47:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很简单 只是处理复杂系统中的不测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It simply deals with unpredictability in complex systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,简称为「蝴蝶效应」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shorthand is the Butterfly Effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.48,0:47:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝴蝶在北京{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A butterfly can flap its wings in Peking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.54,0:47:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在中央公园淋雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in Central Park you get rain instead of sunshine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.60,0:47:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.72,0:47:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说得太笼统了？- 太含糊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I go too fast? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走得太快 我是飞过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a fly-by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.63,0:47:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那杯水给我 实验给你看 我们来做个实验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that glass of water. We're going to conduct an experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该静止 但车子颠簸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be still. The car's bouncing up and down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.51,0:47:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 只是示范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's okay. It's just an example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.81,0:47:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,手做象形文字状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hand flat, like a hieroglyphic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.24,0:47:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在手上落一滴水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's say a drop of water falls on your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.41,0:47:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,水滴会滚向手背还是拇指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way is the drop going to roll off? Which finger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.52,0:47:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…向拇指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumb, I'd say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！好 手静止！静止！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha. Okay. Now freeze your hand. Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.32,0:47:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要同样在同一处滴水 由同一个地方再开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to do the same thing, start with the same place again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.82,0:47:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会往那边流？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way is it gonna roll off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.53,0:47:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,向后…跟前次一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say back. The same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.36,0:47:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一方向 假定是同样向后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same way? Back the same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.63,0:47:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它转向了 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It changed. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.27,0:48:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有微小的变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because tiny variations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.37,0:48:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,汗毛导向改变…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the orientation of the hairs on your hands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.64,0:48:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 你看这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Alan, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.24,0:48:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液的流动 表皮的瑕疵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amount of blood distending your vessels, imperfections in the skin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.18,0:48:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,表皮的瑕疵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperfections in the skin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.85,0:48:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,微细的瑕疵！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Microscopic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.05,0:48:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不重复的瑕疵影响表皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never repeat, and vastly affect the outcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.85,0:48:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可测的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unpredictability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.09,0:48:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.56,0:48:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没有？你看见没有？我又说对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Look at this. See? I'm right again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.36,0:48:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人料到葛博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody could've predicted that Dr. Grant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.27,0:48:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽然跳下行进的车辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would suddenly jump out of a moving vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.50,0:48:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个例子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.77,0:48:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我独处…自言自语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Here I am now by myself, talking to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.61,0:48:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是混乱的原理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's chaos theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.78,0:48:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止这程式！停止！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.61,0:48:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过多少遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you how many times…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.01,0:48:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,车门要装锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we needed locking mechanisms on the vehicle doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.40,0:49:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过贝克写书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I was saying, there's this other book by a guy named Bakker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.21,0:49:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说恐龙类死于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he says the dinosaurs died…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.01,0:49:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上哪去？你看见什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going? You see something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.21,0:49:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有别人认为 我们不该来此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody else who thinks we shouldn'tbe out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.85,0:49:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的书比你的书厚多了 有这么厚！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his book was a lot fatter than yours was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.42,0:49:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 亲爱的 你的书尽是插图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yours was fully illustrated, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.25,0:49:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要紧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.22,0:49:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这个 等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at this. Hey, watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.23,0:49:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呀！快看这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on! Watch this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.73,0:49:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家留在这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.74,0:49:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim. Tim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.99,0:50:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 当然！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.56,0:50:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕！不要紧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be scared. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.66,0:50:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔杜 帮我麻醉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muldoon tranquilized her for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.50,0:50:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她生病了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.87,0:50:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.69,0:50:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！宝贝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.40,0:50:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就喜欢三犄龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my favorite when I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.17,0:50:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是最美丽的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I see her, she's the most beautiful thing I ever saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.74,0:50:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:51:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小水泡 有意思！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Microvesicles. That's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.12,0:51:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 她是什么症状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. What are her symptoms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.12,0:51:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,失衡 无方向感呼吸急促{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imbalance, disorientation, labored breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.46,0:51:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.22,0:51:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这情形似乎已有六周左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to happen about every six weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.22,0:51:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,六周！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.25,0:51:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞳孔放大！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are dilated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.58,0:51:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are? - Take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.15,0:51:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要紧！- 奇怪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - I'll be damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.55,0:51:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是药理效应 来自植物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pharmacological…from local plant life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.60,0:51:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是西印度群岛丁香吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this West Indian Lilac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.37,0:51:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它有毒 动物并不吃它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We know they're toxic, but the animals don't eat them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.21,0:51:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.98,0:51:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常肯定！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.48,0:51:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个方法可以肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to be positive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.58,0:52:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看恐龙的粪便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to see the dinosaur's droppings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.09,0:52:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙粪便？粪便？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dino…Droppings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.63,0:52:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是 我听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. Yeah, I got that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.43,0:52:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风中心 没有消散或是转向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That storm center hasn't dissipated or changed course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.90,0:52:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们得缩短游程了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to cut the tour short, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.44,0:52:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再继续未完的游程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up again tomorrow where we left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.54,0:52:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要缩短吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we have to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.41,0:52:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不值得冒险 约翰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not worth taking the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.61,0:52:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,风速持续四十五海里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sustained winds, 45 knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.55,0:52:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回车上时告诉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them when they get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.81,0:52:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, the last shuttle leaving for the dock…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.75,0:52:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,往码头的最后班车 五分钟后开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaves in approximately five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.12,0:52:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下手边的事马上离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop what you're doing and leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.92,0:52:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.53,0:52:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这泡屎好大！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is one big pile of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.74,0:52:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.48,0:53:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有丁香莓 这就奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no trace of lilac berries. It's so odd, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.95,0:53:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来她每六周 中一次栋树果毒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So she's suffering from melia toxicity every six weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.69,0:53:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…意志坚韧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's tenacious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.66,0:53:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出你的想像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.27,0:53:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吃东西前要洗手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will remember to wash your hands before you eat anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.78,0:53:36.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（执行？）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.48,0:53:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位博士 拜托！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors, if you please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.59,0:53:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要大家走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to insist that we get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.39,0:53:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟哈丁博士 把三犄龙照料好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's okay, I'd like to stay with Dr. Harding and finish up with the trike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.13,0:53:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我有汽油吉普车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I'm in a gas-powered Jeep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.00,0:53:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上船之前 送她到游客中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can drop her at the visitors' center before I make the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.20,0:53:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！如果要续游我会赶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Then I'll catch up with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.94,0:53:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.80,0:54:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 我要陪三犄龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna stay with her a bit longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.71,0:54:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.81,0:54:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.02,0:54:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.62,0:54:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长要我们走就得走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captain says we gotta go, we gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.73,0:54:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行呀 你得给我时间！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the time. I did a test run on this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.33,0:54:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,关机要20分钟 最快也要18分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me 20 minutes. I could maybe push it to 18…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.82,0:54:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最少也要给我15分钟 给我15分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you gotta give me at least 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.37,0:54:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No promises!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.34,0:54:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,游客车辆正在回车库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visitor vehicles are returning to the garage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.25,0:54:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一趟就出那么多事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for our first tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.88,0:54:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,两条龙没出场 一条龙病倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two no-shows and one sick triceratops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.89,0:54:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸中的大幸 也可能更糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've been worse, John. A lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.26,0:54:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁要喝汽水什么的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody want a soda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.56,0:55:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去贩卖机 顺便帮谁带东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the machine. I thought, maybe I'd get somebody something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.67,0:55:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都是吃甜食 想换咸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had only sweets, and I'm gonna get something salty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.07,0:55:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有人想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe somebody would…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.47,0:55:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经更正电话线路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I finished debugging the phones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.67,0:55:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我正要…我做好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna…So I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.98,0:55:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我做的 我更正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to, so I debugged the phones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.11,0:55:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该告诉你 那系统处理要花费…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should tell you the system is gonna be compiling…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.43,0:55:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,18到20分钟 有些小系统会时有时无{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 18 to 20 minutes. Some of the minor systems might go on or off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.99,0:55:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 小事情！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's nothing to worry about. It's a simple thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.00,0:55:33.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（改全岛监控画面 是否执行？）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.02,0:55:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有小孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.32,0:55:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？有 有三个 我喜欢小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, yeah, three. I love kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.16,0:55:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事都可能发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything at all can and does happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.13,0:55:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以老婆也是一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same with wives, for that matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.93,0:56:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你结婚了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.17,0:56:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶而！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.04,0:56:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找未来的离婚对象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm always on the lookout for a future ex-Mrs. Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.36,0:56:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.06,0:56:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.16,0:56:29.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（消毒气锁）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.37,0:56:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.57,0:56:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.51,0:56:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,门户安全系统都关闭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door security systems shutting down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.81,0:56:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯不是说 有些系统会故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Nedry said a few systems would go off-line, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.50,0:57:10.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迅猛龙）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.11,0:57:13.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（暴龙）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.61,0:57:21.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（剑龙）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.15,0:57:28.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（胚胎冷藏 禁区）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.34,0:57:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 塞博士她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, Dr. Sattler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.04,0:57:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是单身？要追她好像是不可能吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's not, like, available, is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.87,0:57:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.54,0:57:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你们俩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sorry. You two are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.95,0:57:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.65,0:57:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what'd I touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.95,0:58:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也没碰 我们停止了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't touch anything. We stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.95,0:58:02.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（努布拉岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.46,0:58:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa. What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.47,0:58:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.40,0:58:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,网墙的电力都断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fences are failing all over the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.80,0:58:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找丹尼斯 检查机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Nedry! Check the vending machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:27.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手控不受理 开启）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.94,0:58:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这张桌子 一塌糊涂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this work station. What a complete slob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.31,0:58:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛禽区的网墙也断电了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The raptor fences aren't out, are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.32,0:59:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有断 还有通电！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. They're still on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.72,0:59:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么把其他的关掉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would he turn the other ones off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.42,0:59:10.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 高压电）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.82,0:59:12.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 通电网墙）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.16,0:59:39.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东码头）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.37,0:59:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,存取主程式！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access main program. Access main security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.01,0:59:52.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（存取安全 不准）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.68,0:59:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,存取主程式！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access main program grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.48,0:59:59.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不准存取 你没念开门咒）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.89,1:00:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没念开门咒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, uh. You didn't say the magic word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.39,1:00:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！可恶 这电脑口令真可恨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Goddamn it! I hate this hacker crap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.23,1:00:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话到剑桥 找丹尼斯的手下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Nedry's people in Cambridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.70,1:00:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话也断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phones are out too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.10,1:00:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆停在那里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did the vehicles stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.96,1:00:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的无线电也断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their radio's out too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.93,1:00:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,金拿罗说别乱跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gennaro said to stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.23,1:00:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩都好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.33,1:00:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问 他们怎么会不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask. Why wouldn't they be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.53,1:00:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩们会怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids get scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.57,1:00:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕什么？电力打嗝而已！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to be scared about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.37,1:00:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say I was scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.57,1:00:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也没说你怕 - 我知道！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't say you were scared. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.24,1:01:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你从那找到那些？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where did you find those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.85,1:01:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我坐位下的箱子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a box under my seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.48,1:01:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 重不重？- 重呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they heavy? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.35,1:01:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是贵重物 放回去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they're expensive. Put 'em back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.69,1:01:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吓我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.27,1:01:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酷 夜视镜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cool. Night vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.90,1:01:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.74,1:02:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是电力要恢复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the power tryin' to come back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.84,1:02:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.09,1:02:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只羊呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the goat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.17,1:03:05.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 一万伏特）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.38,1:03:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.63,1:03:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他丢下我们 他跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left us. He left us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.61,1:03:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想上那儿去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he think he's going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.62,1:03:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拉的时候憋也憋不住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you gotta go, you gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.14,1:04:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.25,1:04:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真恨我每次都说中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, do I hate being right all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.86,1:04:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持绝对静止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep absolutely still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.46,1:04:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只看得见活动之物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its vision is based on movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.01,1:04:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,关灯 关灯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the light off. Turn the light off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.72,1:04:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关灯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the light off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.84,1:05:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉！快点关！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.78,1:05:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.92,1:07:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.94,1:07:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.94,1:07:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 不要动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lan, freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.77,1:07:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救孩子们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.04,1:07:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把火焰丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of the flare!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.28,1:07:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救孩子们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.45,1:07:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把火焰丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of the flare!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.89,1:07:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,万福马利亚…满被圣宠者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hail Mary, full of grace. The Lord be with me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.28,1:07:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.28,1:07:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Lex, I got ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.98,1:08:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卡住了 座椅夹住我的脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck! The seat's got my feet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.82,1:08:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 我等下救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.22,1:08:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事！走 走呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.52,1:08:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！丁姆 丁姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right. Tim! Tim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.00,1:08:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.43,1:08:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不动他就看不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't see us if we don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.54,1:08:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边！快！当心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way…Wait, wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.27,1:09:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝！你勒死我了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex! Lex! You're chokin' me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.17,1:09:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住电线！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the wire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.98,1:09:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住电线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the wire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.99,1:09:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「关键检查空间负零{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Keycheck space minus O, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.89,1:09:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键检查关闭，安全空间负零「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}keychecks off, safety space minus O."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.10,1:09:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把安全系统关掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's turned safety systems off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.33,1:09:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不要任何人看见 他要做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't want anybody to see what he's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.40,1:09:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看下一项输入 这很棘手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look at this next entry. It's the kicker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.80,1:09:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「白兔目标」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"White rabbit object."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.94,1:10:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何它都做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.80,1:10:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键检查关掉了 电脑没存档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the keychecks off, the computer didn't file the keystrokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.81,1:10:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要找他们 必须一一清查电脑线码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only way to find them is to go through the computer's lines of code one by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.71,1:10:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少线码？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many lines of code are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.51,1:10:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,约有两百万条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About two million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.05,1:10:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两百万？- 是呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two million? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.52,1:10:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳勃！也许你会做好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert, I wonder if perhaps you would be good enough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.95,1:10:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开吉普车去接我的孙儿们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take a gas jeep and bring back my grandchildren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.83,1:10:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.93,1:10:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.84,1:10:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.68,1:10:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有丹尼斯 公园无法恢复正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get Jurassic Park back on-line without Dennis Nedry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.48,1:10:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我应该到那边了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have been there by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.35,1:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No damn good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.27,1:11:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.27,1:11:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这条路！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.42,1:11:14.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东码头）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.09,1:11:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这笨玩艺绞离那东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winch this sucker off the thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.19,1:11:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后绑在那个东西上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I tie it to that thing and then I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.03,1:11:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再把这东西拉下来 然后再拉上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull down this thing here and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.01,1:11:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼镜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My glasses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.01,1:11:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买不起眼镜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can afford more glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.66,1:11:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, geez!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.74,1:12:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该做的事你一定做得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got time, you got time. You can do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.54,1:12:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得到 加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it. Come on, Dennis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.65,1:12:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.66,1:12:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！对！那很好！必须走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, that's nice. Gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.47,1:12:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 乖孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice boy. Nice boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.08,1:12:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙乖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.51,1:12:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是那些大恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were one of your big brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.01,1:12:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不错嘛！你要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not so bad. What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.09,1:12:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一点食物吗？你看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want food? Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.18,1:12:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从山坡滚下来 全身湿淋淋 我没带食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just fell down a hill. I'm soakin' wet. I don't have any food!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.92,1:12:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没带食物 什么也没带 去吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no food on me. I have nothing on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.99,1:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！要玩抛接吗？玩抛接？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play fetch? Play fetch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.29,1:13:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 棍子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, see? See stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.60,1:13:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！对！看着棍子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See stick? Yeah, look, stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.30,1:13:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！棍子！棍子！笨呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, stick! Stick, stupid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.93,1:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,去捡棍子 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the stick, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.74,1:13:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这棍子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like the stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.71,1:13:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你会绝种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you're extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.44,1:13:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下我开车把你轧扁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna run you over when I come back down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.99,1:14:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.09,1:14:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝！别哭 别哭 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Lex, listen, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.40,1:14:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝 我在这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.93,1:14:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾你 但是我得先救你弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna look after you, but I have to go help your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.30,1:14:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你在此等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you to stay right here and wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.00,1:14:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他丢下我们 他丢下我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left us. He left us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.74,1:14:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not what I'm gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.31,1:14:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.95,1:15:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.62,1:15:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.65,1:15:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.45,1:15:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没有？我上来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? I'm coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.36,1:15:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌恶爬树！我恨树 太高了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate climbing. I hate trees. Way too high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.66,1:15:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的大树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.40,1:15:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 丁姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.30,1:15:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.21,1:15:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.19,1:16:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要紧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.39,1:16:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呕吐了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.89,1:16:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不要紧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.93,1:16:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,手伸过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.70,1:16:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 我不会跟人家说你吐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't tell anyone you threw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.71,1:16:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管伸手过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.85,1:16:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我抓住你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.93,1:16:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站在门上 - 好了 我抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stand on the door. Hang onto me. - Okay, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.67,1:16:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不错吧 丁姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not too bad, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.14,1:16:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.97,1:16:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是从树屋里出来 你爸帮你盖过树屋吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like coming out of a tree house. Did your dad ever build you one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.44,1:17:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有！- 我爸也没有！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Yeah, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.75,1:17:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬树的要领 是决不要往下看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing about climbing, never look down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.38,1:17:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这不可能 我怎么下去？这有五十英尺高…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is impossible. How am I gonna do this? It's about 50…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.71,1:17:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮助你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna help you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.86,1:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 丁姆 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Tim, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.28,1:17:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快…丁姆 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.73,1:17:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.70,1:18:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.61,1:18:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.75,1:18:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又回到车里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're back in the car again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.52,1:18:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你已离开那棵树了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you're out of the tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.53,1:18:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的车子呢？其他的车子呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the other car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.37,1:18:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.64,1:18:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.04,1:18:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.74,1:18:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛兰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.99,1:18:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那是金拿罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this was Gennaro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.10,1:18:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this was too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.00,1:18:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它大概是在我们前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's ahead of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.41,1:19:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能在任何地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.33,1:19:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,网墙倒了 它可以任意乱跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the fences down, it can wander in and out any paddock it likes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.86,1:19:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑止血带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put a tourniquet on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.25,1:19:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.55,1:19:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我谢约翰 安排的可爱周末{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me to thankJohn for a lovely weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.26,1:19:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以冒险移动他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we chance moving him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.54,1:19:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！冒个险！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please chance it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.35,1:19:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.99,1:19:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.59,1:19:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一辆车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.40,1:19:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.67,1:19:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 亚伦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god. Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.40,1:19:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.13,1:20:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.50,1:20:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊天动地的脚步声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an impact tremor is what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.41,1:20:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里拉警报了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fairly alarmed here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.11,1:20:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快！快！我们得离开这里 必须离开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We gotta get outta here. Now, now! Right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.72,1:20:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 离开这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.32,1:20:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the engine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.73,1:20:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,走快一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must go faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.27,1:20:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它追上来了 踩油门 换五档！- 它来了 它来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here it comes! Fifth gear! - Shit! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.04,1:21:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要坐在手排挡上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the stick! Bloody move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.14,1:21:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.94,1:21:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.10,1:21:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,游程中有这种场面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they'll have that on the tour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.38,1:21:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有在听？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hearing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.52,1:21:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 快！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Tim. Come on, hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.79,1:21:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上这棵树 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get up this tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.60,1:22:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 来呀！不要紧！听话！试爬爬看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's okay. Try up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.20,1:22:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尝试！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.40,1:22:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 爬上去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.61,1:22:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨死树了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.61,1:22:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不厌恶树！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't bother me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.91,1:22:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？刚才的树你没爬过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, well, you weren't in the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.32,1:22:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你看那雷龙 我是说…腕龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, those are brontosauruses. I mean, brachiosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.83,1:22:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在唱歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're singing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.56,1:23:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让那怪兽过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let the monsters come over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.10,1:23:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝 他们不是怪兽 他们是动物 这些是草食动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not monsters, Lex. They're just animals. These are herbivores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.17,1:23:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那表示他们吃素 对你 他们会开晕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means they only eat vegetables, but for you they'd make an exception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.67,1:23:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我恨其他类的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hate the other kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.28,1:23:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他类的 只是做他们该做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other kind just do what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.41,1:23:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.71,1:23:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和爱莉不挖恐龙骨头了 以后要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you and Ellie do if you don't have to pick up dinosaur bones anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.82,1:23:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们只好「进化」一番了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I guess we'll just have to evolve too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.73,1:24:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎恐龙你怎么称呼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call a blind dinosaur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.86,1:24:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 你怎么称呼它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call a blind dinosaur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.37,1:24:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看得见我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do-you-think-he-saurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.67,1:24:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙的导盲犬怎么称呼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about a blind dinosaur's dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.88,1:24:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问倒我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.54,1:24:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看得见雷克斯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A do-you-think-he-saurus' Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.08,1:24:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.75,1:24:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.05,1:24:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们睡着时 恐龙回来怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the dinosaurs come back while we're asleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.96,1:24:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会醒着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll stay awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.96,1:24:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,通宵不睡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.16,1:24:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,通宵！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.51,1:25:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都融掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were all melting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.92,1:25:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马康姆暂时没事 我帮他打了吗啡针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm's okay for now. I gave him a shot of morphine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.93,1:25:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.53,1:25:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,带孩子们穿越公园的任务 谁会比恐龙专家胜任？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who better to get the children through Jurassic Park than a dinosaur expert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.27,1:25:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从苏格兰来时 我盖的东西什么最吸引人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the first attraction I ever built when I came down from Scotland…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.54,1:26:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳蚤杂技团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a flea circus, Petticoat Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.28,1:26:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很棒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really quite wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.75,1:26:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有…小空中飞人还有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a wee trapeze and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.16,1:26:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,转…旋转木马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a merry-go A carousel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.36,1:26:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有秋千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a seesaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.87,1:26:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然都是马达带动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all moved. Motorized, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.47,1:26:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是人们会说他们看得见跳蚤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but people would say they could see the fleas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.67,1:26:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得见跳蚤…妈咪 你看见跳蚤没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, I can see the fleas, Mummy. Can't you see the fleas?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.61,1:26:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳蚤扮小丑 走钢索 游行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown fleas and high-wire fleas and fleas on parade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.22,1:26:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with this place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.72,1:26:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要呈现的不是幻觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to show them something that wasn't an illusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.09,1:26:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是真实的好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.49,1:26:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们看得见摸得着的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that they could see and touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.60,1:26:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是浪得虚名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An aim not devoid of merit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.44,1:27:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不能凭想像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't think through this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.01,1:27:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你必须感触它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.35,1:27:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对！完全正确！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. You're absolutely right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.93,1:27:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我雇用丹尼斯显然是错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiring Nedry was an obvious mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.33,1:27:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 我们过份倚赖自动化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're overdependent on automation. I can see that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.64,1:27:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次一切都可以改正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the next time, everything's correctable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.84,1:27:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.57,1:27:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造是至高的意愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creation is an act of sheer will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.18,1:27:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次的创造将无瑕疵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, it'll be flawless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.65,1:27:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这仍然是跳蚤杂技团 仍是虚幻的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still the flea circus. It's all an illusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.15,1:27:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们再度掌控时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we have control again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.69,1:27:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远控制不了 那是虚幻的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never had control. That's the illusion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.59,1:27:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾被这里的力量所感动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was overwhelmed by the power of this place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.66,1:27:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我也错了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I made a mistake too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.16,1:27:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那种力量不够尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have enough respect for that power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.16,1:27:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's out now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.57,1:27:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有一件事重要 就是我们所爱的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that matters now are the people we love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.97,1:27:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 莉丝 丁姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan and Lex and Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.68,1:28:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 他们在外面有性命之忧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, they're out there where people are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.59,1:28:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.93,1:28:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好吃！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.00,1:28:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜工本！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spared no expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.83,1:28:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.03,1:28:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧！这是腕龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's a brachiosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.63,1:28:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是素食恐龙！莉丝！素食恐龙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a veggie-saurus, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.64,1:29:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,素食！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.94,1:29:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！来！女孩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.18,1:29:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！对！来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.09,1:29:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我不放手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! I'm not letting go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.67,1:29:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像是着凉了 - 对 也许是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looks like it has a cold. - Yeah, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.47,1:29:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以摸吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I touch it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.60,1:29:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 就当它是一头大母牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Just think of it as kind of a big cow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.78,1:29:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢母牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like cows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.89,1:29:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！女孩！上来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, girl. Come on up here, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.32,1:29:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！上来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.90,1:30:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.51,1:30:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 她不会尝试玩新游戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. Now she'll never try anything new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.01,1:30:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会坐在房间里不出门 玩她的电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll just sit in her room and never come out and play on her computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.05,1:30:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是电脑骇客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hacker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.11,1:30:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 你是电脑痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said. You're a nerd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.92,1:30:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 我是电脑骇客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a computer nerd. I prefer to be called a hacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.62,1:30:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.66,1:30:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可知这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.13,1:30:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是恐龙蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dinosaur egg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.83,1:30:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙在繁殖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dinosaurs are breeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.17,1:30:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我外公说 恐龙都是母的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, my grandpa said all the dinosaurs were girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.44,1:30:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,两栖去氧核糖酸 （DNA）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amphibian DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.35,1:30:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.15,1:30:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,游览介绍影片上说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, on the tour, the film said they used…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.85,1:30:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用青蛙的DNA 补基因的断层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}frog DNA to fill in the gene sequence gaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.09,1:31:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们改变恐龙遗传密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mutated the dinosaur genetic code…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.46,1:31:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,混合青蛙的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blended it with that of frogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.37,1:31:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些西非青蛙 在单性别环境里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, some West African frogs have been known to spontaneously change sex…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.37,1:31:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,会本能的改变性别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from male to female in a single-sex environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.98,1:31:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马康姆说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.92,1:31:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.80,1:31:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命会找出路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life found a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.73,1:31:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！那太疯狂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, that's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.60,1:31:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 他真的疯了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your mind. He's absolutely out of his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.63,1:31:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 这究竟是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. What exactly would this mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.31,1:31:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是预估无可避免的损失 这是唯一的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about a calculated risk, which is the only option left to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.21,1:31:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们休想找到丹尼斯指挥法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will never find the command that Nedry used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.79,1:31:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一点破绽都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's covered his tracks far too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.35,1:31:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然他是永远不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's obvious now that he's not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.15,1:31:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以关闭整个系统才是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, shutting down the entire system…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.82,1:31:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找别人 我可不干！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get somebody else, because I won't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.76,1:32:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要消除他所做的一切 唯有关闭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shutting down the system is the only way to wipe out everything that he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.03,1:32:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我的了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as I understand it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.83,1:32:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个系统会以原始模式恢复 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the systems will then come back on their original start-up mode, correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.54,1:32:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上是的！但是我们从未整个关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically, yes. But we've never shut down the entire system before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.94,1:32:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它不会恢复 永远不会！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not come back on at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.64,1:32:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们能恢复电话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will we get the phones back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.24,1:32:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在理论上是可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Again, in theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.04,1:32:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,离氨基酸怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the lysine contingency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.68,1:32:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以使它生效 - 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could put that into effect. - What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.98,1:32:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绝对不行的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is absolutely out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.95,1:32:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,离氨基酸是用来防止…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lysine contingency is intended to prevent the spread of the animals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.40,1:32:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一这些动物离开海岛散布别处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case they ever get off the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.76,1:32:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,吴博士插入一种基因 它在蛋白质新陈代谢中制造单一缺陷的酵素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wu inserted a gene that creates a faulty enzyme in protein metabolism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.59,1:32:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些动物不能造 氨基酸离氨酸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animals can't manufacture the amino acid lysine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.66,1:32:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们靠我们供应离氨酸 否则会昏迷而致死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless they're supplied with lysine by us, they slip into a coma and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.47,1:32:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人性命垂危{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.01,1:32:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你关闭这系统好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please shut down the system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.50,1:33:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold onto your butts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.04,1:33:17.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（总开关）
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.94,1:33:25.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统准备完毕）
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.12,1:33:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 看见那个没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Look. See that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.62,1:33:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动了 成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on. It worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.53,1:33:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 成功了是什么意思？一切都还没电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, it worked? Everything's still off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.96,1:33:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许关闭时冲开了断电器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the shutdown tripped the circuit breakers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.66,1:33:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要再打开 恢复少数系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is turn them on, reboot a few systems{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.23,1:33:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话 安全门 其他几样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}telephones, security doors, half a dozen others, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.54,1:33:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是成功了 系统预备好了 - 断电器在那里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but it worked. System's ready. - Where are the breakers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.14,1:33:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,保养厂 在另一端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintenance shed, the other end of the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.87,1:33:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟内 我可以恢复全园电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes, I can have power back on in the entire park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.84,1:33:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了安全起见 大家到地下避难室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be safe, I want everybody in the emergency bunker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.85,1:34:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等阿诺先生恢复全面运转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until Mr. Arnold returns and the whole system is running again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.65,1:34:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好累！- 我腿疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm tired. I'm hot. - My legs hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.75,1:34:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 向前走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep going, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.85,1:34:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,依地图看 游客中心约在那高地过去一英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The visitors' center is just about a mile over that rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.66,1:34:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管前进！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.30,1:34:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.00,1:34:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 能告诉我 那些是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim, can you tell me what they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.77,1:34:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加…加拉…加里米玛斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gallimimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.68,1:34:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是肉食性…肉食恐龙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those meat eating? "Meat-asaurusses"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.99,1:34:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 队形方向改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the wheeling. Uniform direction changes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.59,1:34:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是鸟群 躲避猎食者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like a flock of birds evading a predator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.70,1:34:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向这边过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're flocking this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.95,1:35:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就想走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.15,1:35:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看它的吃相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look how it eats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.35,1:35:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.56,1:35:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定不会再小看鸟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you never look at birds the same way again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.36,1:35:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的！- 现在走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.29,1:35:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 低身跟我来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Keep low and follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.57,1:35:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好多血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how much blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.57,1:35:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 出差错了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Something went wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.41,1:35:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.98,1:36:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.78,1:36:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是延误 如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a delay, that's all it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.21,1:36:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大游乐园都有延误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All major theme parks have delays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.89,1:36:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一九五六年 迪斯尼乐园开幕时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they opened Disneyland in 1956, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.29,1:36:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一样东西灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.19,1:36:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是海盗馆故障了 不会吃游客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Pirates of the Caribbean breaks down, the pirates don't eat tourists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.99,1:36:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不下去了 出事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait anymore. Something went wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.16,1:36:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去恢复电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get the power back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.63,1:36:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能就这样跑到路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just stroll down the road, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.40,1:36:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们稍安毋躁 他才去了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let's be too hasty. He's only been gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.61,1:36:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.43,1:36:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.23,1:36:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不像开厨房灯那么容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this isn't going to be just like switching on the kitchen light…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.67,1:37:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我能按图指点你过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think I can follow this and then talk you through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.48,1:37:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.85,1:37:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是应该是我去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it ought to be me really going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.95,1:37:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.99,1:37:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…你是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm…And you're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.29,1:37:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.49,1:37:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.76,1:37:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我活着回来 再讨论性别问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can discuss sexism in survival situations when I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.90,1:37:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要带我一步一步走 我用第二频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just take me through this step-by-step. I'm on channel two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.67,1:37:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.70,1:38:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是关闭时 切断网墙的电流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shutdown must have turned off all the fences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.94,1:38:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！丹尼斯也知道这东西不好惹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, even Nedry knew better than to mess with the raptor fences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.22,1:38:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！走这边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.32,1:38:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见厂棚了 快跑可以到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see the shed from here. We can make it if we run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.63,1:38:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 过不去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.07,1:38:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.77,1:38:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们已成猎物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're being hunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.47,1:38:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.27,1:38:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在正前方的树丛里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the bushes, straight ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.74,1:38:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.64,1:38:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧才怪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.35,1:38:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑步 奔向厂棚！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run. Towards the shed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.75,1:38:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞄准她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.25,1:38:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！现在！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.89,1:39:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿诺先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Arnold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.09,1:39:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿诺先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Arnold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.63,1:39:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.09,1:39:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！你前方有金属楼梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Now ahead of you is a metal staircase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.43,1:39:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,下楼梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go down it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.30,1:39:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.64,1:39:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去二 三十英尺 到一处T站 左转！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After 20 or 30 feet you come to a T-junction. Take a left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.51,1:39:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须跟主电缆走 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have her follow the main cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.71,1:39:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得懂图表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand how to read a schematic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.12,1:39:53.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 一万伏特）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.04,1:40:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那大概是表示电源关了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that means the power's off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.46,1:40:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.96,1:40:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.66,1:40:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以…我们可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe, we could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.31,1:40:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 是死路！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Dead end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.22,1:41:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.99,1:41:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面应该有右转处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should have been a right turn back there somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.19,1:41:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 看你的上方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, look above you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.69,1:41:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有一大捆管线 朝同一方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be a large bundle of cable and pipes heading in the same direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.13,1:41:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着它走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.50,1:41:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟着管线走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Following the piping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.30,1:41:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 打赌我已翻过那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I could climb over the top…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.55,1:41:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你还没爬到顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be on the other side before you could get to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.91,1:41:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了给我什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you give me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.41,1:41:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.31,1:41:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这不是竞赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys, it's not a race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.85,1:41:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见箱子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.92,1:41:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,写着「高压电」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says "high voltage."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.03,1:41:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.43,1:41:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.44,1:41:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time, Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.74,1:41:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.77,1:41:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,找立足点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find your footing. Find your footing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.74,1:42:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 你不能徒手扳开关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, you can't throw the main switch by hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.58,1:42:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须将主把手充压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to pump up the primer handle in order to get the charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.08,1:42:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是巨大扁平的灰色东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's large, flat and gray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.25,1:42:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here I go. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.76,1:42:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.26,1:42:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,充压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Charged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.46,1:42:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在「接触位置」字样下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the words "contact position"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.47,1:42:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有圆形的绿色钮 上有「按停」字样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a round, green button which says, "push to close."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.57,1:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「按停」 好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Push to close." Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.08,1:42:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,按它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.39,1:42:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 红色钮是开个别的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Ellie, the red buttons turn on the individual park systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.10,1:42:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们按开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch 'em on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.00,1:42:57.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（降落场… 游客中心…）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.81,1:43:04.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（周界网墙）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.44,1:43:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.61,1:43:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 你必须跳下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.05,1:43:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 我不跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crazy? I'm not gonna jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.86,1:43:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 听葛博士的 快跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what Dr. Grant says!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.45,1:43:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我数到三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go! I'll count to three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.62,1:43:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一！二！三！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.03,1:43:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室 游览！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control room. Tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.13,1:43:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很容易接！松手 我在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming up to get you. I've gotta get Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.84,1:43:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我数到三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm gonna count to three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.54,1:43:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.68,1:43:28.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（暴龙网墙）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.05,1:43:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,二！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.56,1:43:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有气了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.36,1:43:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈先生 我们又开业了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hammond, I think we're back in business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.47,1:44:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.29,1:44:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿诺先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr. Arnold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.97,1:45:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的女孩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.72,1:45:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.59,1:45:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Tim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.40,1:46:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy. Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.20,1:46:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子！丁姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy. Good boy, Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.14,1:46:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,三！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.51,1:46:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.62,1:46:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我得找到其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm gonna have to find the others…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.26,1:46:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你看医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}get you to a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.03,1:46:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉丝 你照顾丁姆！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex, you look after Tim. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.83,1:46:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！瞧你怒发冲冠！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hair is all sticking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.54,1:46:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 活烤生人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big Tim, the human piece of toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.14,1:46:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快会回来 保证！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back soon. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.08,1:47:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.77,1:47:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.87,1:47:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.16,1:48:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the two raptors, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.76,1:48:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定第三只 被关住了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure the third one's contained?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.67,1:48:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 除非他们会开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Unless they figure out how to open doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.80,1:49:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 是什么龙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.90,1:49:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a velociraptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.80,1:49:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.76,1:49:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.40,1:52:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.73,1:52:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.24,1:52:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以求救吗？- 我们得先恢复系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can call for help? - We gotta reboot the system first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.51,1:52:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,上门闩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door locks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.71,1:52:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 上门闩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, boot up the door locks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.12,1:52:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上门闩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boot up the door locks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.43,1:52:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱莉 退后 去上门闩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, get back! Boot up the door locks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.96,1:52:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人挡不住它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hold it by yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.24,1:53:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是UNIX系统 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a UNIX system. I know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.54,1:53:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全园的资料 能告诉你一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all the files of the whole park. It tells you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.08,1:53:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找出正确的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find the right file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.08,1:53:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那把枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to reach the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.89,1:53:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我动才能拿到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get it unless I move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.18,1:53:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是正确的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might be the right file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.61,1:53:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这资料不对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. It's coming. This isn't the right file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.09,1:53:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 莉丝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.70,1:54:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到了 - 是呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.40,1:54:04.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统封闭）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.20,1:54:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.54,1:54:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀！好呀！就是它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes, this is it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.94,1:54:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些通了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.11,1:54:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话 安全系统 你说得出来的都通了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phones, security systems. You name it, we got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.96,1:54:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛兰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.02,1:54:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈先生 电话通了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hammond, the phones are working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.63,1:54:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.16,1:54:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们平安！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children are fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.76,1:54:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知大陆派直升机来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the mainland. Tell 'em to send the damn helicopters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.73,1:54:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快冲进来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna come through the glass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.84,1:54:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛兰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.40,1:55:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Quick! Tim, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.48,1:56:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁姆 放手！走呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim, let go. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.36,1:57:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈先生 慎重考虑之后 我决定不替你背书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After careful consideration, I've decided not to endorse your park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.06,1:57:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不玩了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.19,1:58:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧！不要怕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.91,1:58:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
